      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>18</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>50</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>50</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>det</mi><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></math></p><p>Characteristic equation of the matrix is&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>4</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mi>&#945;</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#955;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>&#955;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi>&#955;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Comparing with given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>A</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mi>A</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>18</mn><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p><p>Hence&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>det</mo><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn></math></p></blockquote>"
  }
